            "topicDescription": "Layered architecture patterns for Android: domain, data, and presentation boundaries.",
            "questions": [
                {
                    "questionText": "In Clean Architecture, where should core business rules and use cases live?",
                    "difficulty": "BEGINNER",
                    "explanation": "Business logic belongs in the domain layer so it stays independent of frameworks, UI, and data sources.",
                    "answers": [
                        {
                            "answerText": "Presentation layer",
                            "isCorrect": false
                        },
                        {
                            "answerText": "Data layer",
                            "isCorrect": false
